# landmark (assets/world3d/downs/landmark.set, hand-placed)
# Wheyward Downs: rolling chalk-green hills behind, a stack of cheese wheels
# on each hay rick, a lone thorn on the hill and the cheese-chuck flag.
frustum  grass   at 76 0 -12 size 170 34 56 id downs-hill-w
sphere   grass   at 76 22 -12 size 104 40 50 id downs-hill-w-crest
